# Portable-build outputs and release zips — gitignored build artifacts, ~2.5GB combined. Without
# these the Dockerfile's `COPY . .` ships them INTO the image (and every build spends a minute
# transferring them as build context). Added 2026-09-06 after a verification build watched the
# context climb past 1.5GB. See docs/CURRENT_BACKLOG.md's B46 row.
